OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with cloudy skies
OL,6,Ftoday. However, some breaks in the
OL,7,Fcloud will give sunny spells at times.
OL,8,FA few showers are possible at time
OL,9,Facross the north of the region.
OL,10,FFeeling pleasant in the sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud will thicken tonight
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of light rain moving
OL,14,Fin. Staying mild under the blanket of
OL,15,Fcloud with a gentle breeze.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FStaying largely cloudy on
OL,18,FSunday with further outbreaks of rain
OL,19,Fpossible at times. The rain will be
OL,20,Fmostly light, although some heavier
OL,21,Fbursts are possible in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
