OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FTurning more unsettled in the outlook
OL,7,Fwith a spell of heavy rain on Monday.
OL,8,FScattered heavy showers and sunny
OL,9,Fspells will move in through Tuesday
OL,10,Fand Wednesday. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
